<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">EZRPOK.SFK 29-02-2,008. Adelina Quej. Pocomchi. Updated for DBL by G. Grasso and E. Canales, Dec 2012, standardization after migration to PT8 by A. Camus March, 2019.</book>
  <para style="h">ESDRAS</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esd</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esd</para>
  <para style="toc1">ESDRAS</para>
  <para style="mt2">RE' I RUHUUJ I ESDRAS</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESDRAS</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' i k'uhb'aal xupuhkaaj ruq'orariik i reey Ciro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:22-23">2 Cron 36.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chupaam i peet haab' rokiik chi reyil i Ciro ar Persia, re' i QaJaaw Dios reh chi xooj eloq wach i ruk'uhb'aal ruq'orom cho ruuk' chii' i Jeremías jalal ruq'oral, xuyeew paránima i Ciro chi naa ruq'orom ruuk' chii', chi naa rutaq'aam ruq'orariik panhuuj chupaam chu'nchel i tinamit taqe i k'uhb'aal wili:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' hin Ciro i kireey i aj Persia i nuq'or taq aweh i q'orik wili: Re' QaJaaw Dios wilik pan taxaaj xuyeew panuq'ab' chu'nchel i tinamit wach ak'al, xuyeew panuq'ab' chi naa nuyejaam i rupaat i Dios ar Jerusaleem wilik ar Judá. <verse number="3" style="v" />Je' re' noq wila' hat taq rutinamiit i Dios neerub'an chi nee taq tiooj Jerusaleem chi rutinamiit i rupaat i Dios re' i ki Dios i aj Israel. Re' i reh i Dios inkiloq'ej ar Jerusaleem. Re' ta naq i QaJaaw Dios neentoob'inik taq aweh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh nik' k'ihaal i xi kahnik chi k'achalkeeb' chupaam i ju'jun chi ye'aab', inchol kitob'eem i kika'jaah naa kojiik ye'jan reh i rupaat i Dios ruuk' i ruye'ariik i plata, i oro. Eh naakiye'em i kichikoop, naakiye'em i kimayiij xanaa ruchaliik pankik'ux, reh chi naa rukamaniik parupaat i Dios ar Jerusaleem.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i aj Israel wilkeeb' naq Babilonia xi sutinik wo' chik Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw Dios xuq'or pankanima i k'amal kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Judá, je' wo' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Benjamín, je' wo' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, je' wo' taqe i aj Levíta chi xkichop kik'ux chi ojik Jerusaleem chi rutinamiit i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i kika'jaah xtoob'inik keh ruuk' i ruye'ariik i plata, i oro, taqe chikop, ruuk' taqe i xa chib'ih jariik k'ih tz'aaq, eh ruuk' i ruye'ariik i kimayiij xan chalik pankik'ux. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' reey Ciro reh xuq'asaj taqe i kulk inkamanik parupaat i Dios. Re' taqe i relq'aam reje Jerusaleem i reey Nabucodonosor xuk'am taqe reje Babilonia xuyeew parupaat taqe i rutiyoox. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' i Ciro kireey i aj Persia xuq'or reh i Mitrídates molol tumiin chi naa rajlaam taqe i kulk, noq naa ruq'asam reh Sesbasar wilik chi taaq'anik ar Judá. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taqe kulk xrajlaaj je' wili kik'ihaal: Lajeeb' ru ka'winaq i nimaq kulk, re' ruuk' i oro, jinaj miil i nimaq kulk re' ruuk' i plata, eh b'elejeeb' ru ka'winaq i kuchilo. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh lajeeb' ru ka'winaq i kulk re' ruuk' i oro, kijib' siento ruuk' lajeeb' i kulk re' ruuk' i plata, eh jinaj miil taqe i xa chib'ih jariik kikamanik wii'. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i kulk re' ruuk' i oro, i plata ho'oob' miil ruuk' kijib' siento. Chu'nchel i re' xuk'am chaloq Jerusaleem i Sesbasar, noq xi sutinik cho Babilonia, haa' taqe i xi elik wo' chik cho Babilonia.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i xi sutinik cho Babilonia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NEH 7:5-73">Neh 7.5-73</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' taqe i wili i aj Israel i a-sjinaq taqe paruyuq'ul i Judá. Re' i ruk'amam taqe reje Babilonia i reey Nabucodonosor, xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem. Eh ar xi kahnik chupaam i kitinamiit chi kiju'junaal paruyuq'ul i Judá. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' taqe i xk'amwik cho kib'eeh je' wili kib'ihnaal:</para>
  <para style="p">Zorobabel, Jesúa, Nehemías, Seraías, Reelaias, Mardoqueo, Bilsán, Mizpar, Bigvai, Rehum, Baana, je' wili kik'ihaal i winaq aj Israel xi chalik: <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Paros, kiib' miil ruuk' jinaj siento ruuk' kab'laj ru kajwinaq taqe. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Sefatías ixib' siento ruuk' kab'laj ru kajwinaq taqe. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Ara wuquub' siento ruuk' ho'lajuuj ru kajwinaq taqe. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Pahat-moab, re' ruuk' taqe chaloq i Jeúsa, i Joab kiib' miil ruuk' waxiqiib' siento ruuk' kab'laj taqe. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Elam, kiib' miil ruuk' kiib' siento ruuk' kajlaj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Zatu, b'elejeeb' siento ruuk' hoob' roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taqe riih rumaam Zacai, wuquub' siento ruuk' oxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam Bini, waqiib' siento ruuk' kiib' roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' taqe riih rumaam i Bebai, waqiib' siento ruuk' ixib' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe riih rumaam i Azgad, jinaj miil ruuk' kiib' siento ruuk' kiib' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Adonicam waqiib' siento ruuk' waqiib' ru kajwinaq taqe. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Bigvai, kiib' miil ruuk' waqlaj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Adín, kijib' siento ruuk' kajlaj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Ater, re' ruuk' taqe Ezequías kiib' chik ma' jinaj siento taqe. <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taqe riih rumaam i Bezai, ixib' siento ruuk' ixib' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' taqe riih rumaam i Jora jinaj siento ruuk' kab'laj taqe. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam Hasum, kiib' siento ruuk' ixib' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Gibar ho'oob' chik ma' jinaj siento taqe. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Belén jinaj siento ruuk' ixib' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="22" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Netofa, waqlaj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="23" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Anatot, jinaj siento ruuk' waxiqiib' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="24" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Azmavet kiib' roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam i Quiriat-jearim, i Cafira i Beerot, wuquub' siento ruuk' ixib' roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="26" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam i Rama, i Geba waqiib' siento ruuk' jinaj ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="27" style="v" />Re' taqe riih rumaam i Micmas, jinaj siento ruuk' kiib' ru ka'winaq, taqe. <verse number="28" style="v" />Re' kiih kimaam i Bet-el, i Hai, kiib' siento ruuk' ixib' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="29" style="v" />Re' taqe riih rumaam i Nebo, kab'laj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="30" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Magbis, jinaj siento ruuk' waqlaj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="31" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Elam jinaj chik, jinaj miil ruuk' kiib' siento ruuk' kajlaj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="32" style="v" />Re' taqe riih rumaam i Harim, ixib' siento ruuk' juninaq taqe. <verse number="33" style="v" />Re' taqe kiih kimaam i Lod, i Hadid, i Ono, wuquub' siento ruuk' ho'oob' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="34" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Jericó, ixib' siento ruuk' ho'oob' roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="35" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Senaa, ixib' miil ruuk' waqiib' siento ruuk' lajeeb' ru ka'winaq taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam Jedaías, re' ruuk' taqe i Jesua b'elejeeb' siento ruuk' oxlaj ru kajwinaq taqe. <verse number="37" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Imer, jinaj miil ruuk' kab'laj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="38" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Pasur jinaj miil ruuk' kiib' siento ruuk' wuquub' roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="39" style="v" />Re' taqe i riih rumaam Harim jinaj miil ruuk' wuqlaj taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Levíta Jesúa, re' ruuk' taqe Cadmiel, re' wo' ruuk' i taqe i riih rumaam i Hadavías kajlaj rukajwinaq taqe. <verse number="41" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i aj tz'uyineel re' ruuk' taqe riih rumaam i Asaf jinaj siento ruuk' waxiqiib' ru ka'winaq taqe. <verse number="42" style="v" />Re' taqe i kicha'jinik reh i ru puertahiil i rupaat i Dios re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Salum, i Ater, i Talmón, i Acub, i Hatita, i Sabai, jinaj siento ruuk' b'elejlaj ru ka'winaq taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Re' taqe i kikamanik parupaat i Dios re' taqe i kiih kimaam Sihá, i Hasufa, i Tobaot, <verse number="44" style="v" />i Queros, i Siaha, i Padón, <verse number="45" style="v" />i Lebana, i Hagaba, i Acub, <verse number="46" style="v" />Hagab, i Salmai, i Hanán, <verse number="47" style="v" />i Gidel, i Gahar, i Reaía, <verse number="48" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam Rezín, Necoda, i Gazam, <verse number="49" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam i Uza, i Paseah, i Besai, <verse number="50" style="v" />Re' kiih kimaam i Asena, i Meunim, Nefusim. <verse number="51" style="v" />Re' kiih kimaam i Bacbuc, i Hacufa, i Harhur, <verse number="52" style="v" />Re' kiih kimaam Bazlut, i Mehída, i Harsa. <verse number="53" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam i Barcos, i Sisara, i Tema. <verse number="54" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam Nezía, Hatifa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam taqe i xi kamanik ruuk' i reey Salomón, re' ruuk' taqe i kiih kimaam Sotai i Soferet, i Peruda. <verse number="56" style="v" />Re' taqe kiih kimaam i Jaala, i Darcón, i Gidel. <verse number="57" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam i Sefatías, i Hatil, i Poqueret-hazebaim, i Ami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i xi kamanik chupaam i rupaat i Dios, re' taqe i kiih kimaam i xi kamanik ruuk' i Salomón ach waxiqiib' ma' kijib' siento taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Re' taqe i wili xi chalik Tel-mela, i Tel-harsa, Querub, Addán, Imer, eh re' taqe i ma' eht'alimaj taj mi re' ruuk' taqe i aj Israel oon ma' re' taj re' taqe wili: <verse number="60" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam i Delaía, i Tobías, i Necoda, waqiib' siento ruuk' kab'laj roxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="61" style="v" />Re' taqe i kiih kimaam i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij re' taqe wili: Re' i riih Habaía re' taqe i riih i Cos, re' taqe i riih rumaam i Barzilai, re' i xub'an kaxáro ruuk' jinaj ixoq re' ruuk' taqe i rixq'uun i Barzilai aj Galaad, xukoj i rub'ihnaal chi je' rukab' i kib'ihnaal i keh. <verse number="62" style="v" />Re' taqe re', xsik'arik i kib'ihnaal i kimaam kati't panhuuj, chi ma' xkan taj i kib'ihnaal ruum aj re' ma' xikojarik ta chi k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij. <verse number="63" style="v" />Eh re' intaaq'anik chupaam i tinamit xuq'or chi ma' naa ta kik'uxum keh i k'uxumb'al kuxisamaj ko wilik jino'q i kajaaw i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij narusik'wiik chi riij chi rukojom i Urim reh chi ruk'ux je' wo' hoq i Tumim.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit xkimol cho kiib' xi chalik Jerusaleem, kiib' roxk'ahl miil ruuk' ixib' siento ruuk' oxk'ahl taqe. <verse number="65" style="v" />Eh chi ma' xi ajaljik ta haa' taqe i kimoso chi winaq chi ixoq wuquub' miil ruuk' ixib' siento ruuk' wuqlaj ru ka'winaq chi kiib'. Eh ma' xi ajaljik ta wo' haa' taqe kaj tz'uyineel chi winaq chi ixoq kiib' siento chi kiib'. <verse number="66" style="v" />Eh wuq'uub' siento ruuk' waqlaj ru ka'winaq i ki imas kawáyu, eh kiib' siento ruuk' ho'oob' roxk'ahl i ki ixoq kawáyu. <verse number="67" style="v" />Eh kijib' siento ruuk' ho'lajuuj ru ka'winaq i kicameyo, eh waqiib' miil ruuk' wuquub' siento ruuk' juninaq i kib'uruux.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Eh wilik taqe i kik'amwik kib'eeh i ju'jun chi patineel noq xi ponik Jerusaleem xponik kiq'asaj i kimayiij reh chi naa wo' chik rukorjiik chi korik i rupaat i Dios chupaam i ye'aab' korjinaq wii' pampeet. <verse number="69" style="v" />Eh xkiyeew nik' kihaal i xkian ruye'ariik, yejemb'al reh chi korik i rupaat i Dios. Jinaj miil ruuk' lajeeb' ru ka'winaq libra i oro. Eh hoob' miil libra i plata, jinaj siento i kiso' i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xkiyeew.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Wilik taqe i aj Israel xi kahnik chi patinik ar Jerusaleem, wilik wo' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, taqe i aj Levíta xi kahnik ar. Eh re' taqe i kaj tz'uyineel re' taqe i kicha'jinik reh i ru puertahiil i rupaat i Dios, je' wo' taqe i ruk'ihaal aj Israel xi kahnik chi patinik pam kitinamiit chi kiju'junaal.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Xkiyejaa' wo' chik i artaal loq'oomb'al reh i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq wuquub' chik poh kisutinik chaloq i aj Israel wilkeeb' chik pan kitinamiit chi kiju'junaal, chu'nchel i tinamit xkimol wo' chik kiib' Jerusaleem. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i Jesúa i rak'uun i Josadac, eh taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij taqe i kik'uliil, eh i Zorobabel rak'uun i Salatiel, taqe i ma' tokoom ta ruuk' xtohq'ik kiyejaam i ru artaal i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel. Reh chi xkik'at i mayijimaj chikop chinaah, je' rukab' i ruq'or i k'uhb'aal ye'ooj ree Moisés raj kamanoom i Dios. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh xkiyejaa' i artaal aha' naq wilik pampeet ruum kiyo'jik kuum i tinamit wilkeeb' wach ak'al, xkik'at i mayijimaj chikop chinaah i artaal re' re', rajlaal wahq'eq, rajlaal xq'eq, ye'b'al ruloq'il i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh xkian ninq'iij reh kok' perpat, je' wo' rukab' i tz'ihb'amaj rehtaliil reh i t'iosinik chuwach i Dios, reh chi xiko'ljik. Eh rajlaal wo' q'iij inkiq'asaj chi mayiij i k'atoj chikop, je' rukab' i kanamaj rub'aan, eh paruq'ijil wo' xkian. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh kiq'asaj wo' hoq i k'atoj chikop chi kimayiij i re' i okrinaq taqe chi ye'arik eqal eqal inki q'aasaj, je' wo' hoq i mayiij reh i ak' poh, je' wo' hoq i k'atoj mayiij reh i nimaq wach ninq'iij loq'oomb'al reh i QaJaaw Dios, je' wo' i mayiij xan chalik pankik'ux ruye'ariik. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh pank'amb'al rub'eeh i ruwuuq poh xkitoq'aa' ruye'ariik i k'atoj chikop chi kimayiij loq'oomb'al reh i QaJaaw Dios atoob' ta komajaa' inkitoq'aa' ruyejeb'jiik i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh kitoj wo' taqe i aj tz'aqool, je' wo' taqe i aj sehk, xkiyeew wo' kiwa' kihaa', kaseite i aj Tiro, i aj Sidón, reh chi naa kik'amam chaloq i holohaq chee' chakaltee' wilik ar Líbano. Reh chi xkik'am chaloq Jope nah palaw, je' rukab' i xye'arik q'ab' keh ruum Ciro kireey i aj Persia.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' noq xtohq'ik wo' chik rukorb'eesjiik chi korik i rupaat i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh parukab' poh reh i rukab' haab' kik'uliik iloq parupaat i Dios Jerusaleem i aj Israel noq xi elik cho Babilonia re' i Zorobabel rak'uun i Salariel, re' Jesúa rak'uun i Josadac re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, taqe i aj Levíta taqe i xi sutinik chaloq xi okik chi ruyejeb'jiik i rupaat i Dios. Eh re' taqe i aj Levíta ik'inaq taqe juninaq haab' xkikanaa' chi rilariik i kamanik re' re'. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' taqe i xi k'amwik kib'eeh i xiyej-anik reh i rupaat i Dios je' wili kib'ihnaal: Jesúa ruch'ihil taqe rak'uun, re' taqe ma' tokoom ta ruuk', re' Cadmiel rak'uun Jodavias re' taqe i rak'uun, re' Henadad, re' taqe rak'uun, re' taqe ma' tokoom ta ruuk'. Chu'nchel i re' aj Levíta taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh noq xkikoj raa' i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios taqe i aj tz'aqool, re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xkikoj chikiij i kiso' inkikoj parukamaj Dios, eh wilik kituun pan kiq'ab'. Eh re' taqe i aj Levíta i riih taqe Asaf xkiq'ojej i kipulato q'ooj chi loq'oomb'al reh i QaJaaw Dios. Xkian wo' hoq je' rukab' i ruq'orom kahnoq i David wihinaq chi reyil Israel. <verse number="11" style="v" />Wilik taqe i xkian kitz'uuy chi loq'oomb'al reh i QaJaaw Dios, eh chi, je' wili i xkiq'or: Qat'iosej taq i rotob'il i QaJaaw Dios ruum re' reh q'e' atoob', eh juneliik i ruketelaaj qawach i hoj, hoj aj Israel, inki taqe. Eh chu'nchel i tinamit suq kik'ux k'erlik kichii' chulooq'jiik Dios ruum k'ahchi' rukojariik chee raa' i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh ma' k'isiin taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij re' ruuk' taqe i aj Levíta mama' winaq chik taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i ju'jun chi patineel xi ilwik reh i rupaat i Dios xwihik cho pampeet noq xkilow chi k'ahchi' rokiik i raa' i rupaat i Dios xak'erik chik kichii' chi oq'ik. Eh ma' k'isiin wo' taqe i k'erik kichii' ruum i rusuqkiil kik'ux. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh chi najt i nib'irjik chee oq'ik inki a'n xa re' la' ma' xkireq ta chi riij i tinamit awach taqe i k'erik kichii' ruum i rusuqkiil kik'ux, eh awach i oq'ik inki a'n.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i aj ixowan kiwach i aj Israel xkaaj naq kiyojom wach i ruyejeb'jiik i rupaat i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh noq re' taqe i nixowanik kiwach i aj Judá, i aj Benjamín xkib'iraj rib'iral chi re' taqe i xi sutinik cho pan tokoom tinamit k'ahchi' wo' chik kiyejaam i rupaat i Dios i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' keh xiooj ruuk' i Zorobabel ruuk' i Josúa, kuuk' k'amal kib'eeh i ju'jun chi patineel je' wili i xkiq'or:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' hoj inqaaj chi nee taq tiqatow chi rutinamiit i rupaat i Dios, ruum re' hoj inqayeew wo' ruloq'il taq aaDios je' rukab' i na a'n taq i hat. Eh inqaq'asaj wo' qamayiij chuwach i Dios, xa re' wo' rokiik cho chi reyil Asiria i Esar-hadón re' i xtaaq'anik cho qeh ayu', inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh re' i Zorobabel, i Josúa, ruch'ihil taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i ju'jun ch'uq chi patineel je' wili i chaq'wik xkian:</para>
  <para style="p">Ma' chih taj ma' nee ta ruyeew riib' chi nee taq ti okik haa' chub'anariik wili. Re' i rupaat i qaDios i hoj, i hoj aj Israel, xa re' hoj aj Israel naa qayej-aniik reh ruum je' re' i xuq'or i Ciro kireey i aj Persia, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' taqe i aj ixowaal wilkeeb' chupaam i ye'aab' re' re' xtohq'ik kiyojom kik'ux taqe i aj Judá reh chi naa ruchaliik kiyo'jiik reh naq chi naa kikanaam ruyejeb'jiik i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj ixowaal xkiyeew rutumiin taqe i kitaaq'anik chupaam i tinamit reh naq chi ma' naa ta kiye'em q'ab' keh i aj Israel chi naa kiyejaam i rupaat i Dios. Eh re' taqe i aj taq'oom xkinimaj i xkiq'or i aj ixowaal nik' najtiil xwihik chi reyil i Ciro ar Persia korehtaal chik xokik chi reyil i Dario ar Persia. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh noq xokik chi reyil ar i Asuero re' taqe i aj ixowaal xkitz'ihb'aaj i kimahk taqe i aj Judá, eh taqe i aj Jerusaleem. <verse number="7" style="v" />Noq re' chik i Artajerjes wilik chi reyil Persia, re' Bislam, re' i Mitrídates, re' Tabeel, je' wo' kuch'ihil xkitz'ihb'aaj jinaj i huuj pan kiq'oral i aj arameo, eh xkiq'asaj pan kiq'oral i aj Persa, eh xkiq'asaj reh i Artajerjes. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' i Rehum i kajaaw i soldado, re' i Simsai i aj tz'ihb', xkitz'ihb'aaj jinaj i huuj kojb'al kimahk i aj Jerusaleem xkiq'asaj reh i Artajerjes. <verse number="9" style="v" />Chupaam i q'iij re' re', wilik i xkitz'ihb'aaj reje jinaj i huuj i Rahum i kajaaw soldado, re' i Simsai, re' i aj tz'ihb', kuch'ihil taqe i q'atal q'orik, je' wo' taqe i kitaaq'anik chinaah i Persia, re' taqe i aj Erec, re' taqe i aj Babilonia, re' taqe aj Susa, iraaj ruq'orom chi re' taqe i aj elamita. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh kuch'ihil taqe i tokoom tinamit xitaq'ab'jik cho chi wihik Samaria ruum i Asnapar nim rajaawriik. Eh ruch'ihil taqe i k'amal b'eeh wilkeeb' chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh je' wili i ruq'or chupaam i huuj xkiq'asaj:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">Hat reey Artajerjes re' hoj, i hoj awaj kamanoom wilkooj ayu' chi juntar i nim ha' inqataq'aaj rusuqkiil ak'ux.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hat qajaaw reey inqaaj chi neenanab'eej chi re' taqe i aj Judío xi elik cho chupaam aatinamiit xi k'uloq Jerusaleem xtohq'ik wo' chik kiyejaam i tinamit yiib' wach kina'ojb'al, ma' kinimanik taj, xtohq'ik wo' chik kiyejaam i koraal tz'aq, xtohq'ik wo' chik kikojom i raa'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' i hat reey inqaaj chi neenanab'eej chi wila' xkiyejaa' wo' chik chi korik i tinamit, wila' xkiyejaa' wo' chik i koraal tz'aq chi riij, re' taqe i tinamit ma' xta chik i neenkaaj kitojom riij. Wila' xkian i je' re' ma' k'isiin i tumiin nee naq'eb' i hat qareey. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ruum chi re' hoj, k'ahchi'kooj atoob'eem ma' xata naa qilom chi ma' naa ta kinimam aak'uhb'aal i hat reey. Ruum aj re' inqataq'aaj ruq'orariik aweh taqe wili. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' hat qajaaw reey neerub'an chi neenasik' chupaam i huuj, ar neenareq chib'ih i xk'ularik cho chikiwach aamaam awati't. Ar neenareq chi re' taqe i tinamit Jerusaleem xa keh chi ma' kinimanik taj, eh ma' holohik taj i kina'ojb'al. Re' re' k'axik i ruk'am cho cha weh i hat, je' wo' chi keh i tinamit ruum yiib' wach i kina'ojb'al, re' re' sacharik wach i kitinamiit najtir. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' hoj qajaaw reey inqaq'or aweh chi wila' xkorjik wo' chik chi korik i tinamit, eh wila' xkorjik wo' chik i koraal tz'aq chi riij. Eh ma' nee ta chik inkaaj wihik chi ri'sil awajaawriik taqe i wilkeeb' ayu' chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates, inki taqe reje panhuuj.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Noq xrib'iraj chi je' re' i reey Artajerjes, je' wili i xutaq'aaj ruq'orariik keh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">Re' hin nutz'ihb'aaj i huuj wili reh i Rehum i kajaaw soldado, reh i Simsai i aj tz'ihb', keh i kuch'ihil wilkeeb' Samaria, je' wo' keh i wilkeeb' chi juntar i nim ha'. Re' ta naq i suq kiil k'uxliis neen wihik taq awuuk'.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' huuj taq xataq'aaj cho weh x-ilarik chik wach chi nuwach. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh xnutaq'aaj ruq'orariik chi xsik'arik panhuuj, xkan wo' ar chi re' taqe i tinamit re' re' xama' inkinimaj ta wo' taqe i reey wihinaq taqe chaloq najtir, eh inkiq'at wach i kiq'oral i reey. <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh Jerusaleem xi wihik wo' naq chee reey xti wilik kajaawriik, xwihik kajaawriik chi taaq'anik chikinaah i tinamit wilkeeb' ar chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates, inkitoj riij chu'nchel i xa chib'ih jariik i wilik keh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin i nuqor taq aweh i hat jinaj i k'uhb'aal chi cha q'or taq keh i winaq re' re' chi kipab'aa' i kamanik, kikanaa' ruyejeb'jiik i tinamit kore' chik i hin naa nuq'oriik jaruuj inkorjik. <verse number="22" style="v" />Inwaaj i hin chi nee taq i na a'n chi korik i nuq'or taq aweh, maa yeew taq q'ab' chi nenooj chi nimaal i ti' k'axik chi qanaah i hoj i wilkooj chi reyil, inki reje.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh noq x-ilarik wach i huuj xutaq'aaj reje i reey Artajerjes chuwach i Rehum, chuwach i Simsai i aj tz'ihb', chikiwach i kuch'ihil. Re' keh kajimam kiib' xiooj Jerusaleem, pank'aah xkiq'or reh taqe i aj Judío chi kipab'aa' i kamanik xkitoq'aa' rub'aan. <verse number="24" style="v" />Je' aj re' noq xkikanaa' i kamanoom ruyejeb'jiik i rupaat i Dios ar Jerusaleem. Korehtaal chik xponik parukab' haab' rokiik chi reyil i Dario ar Persia.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ruyejeb'jiik chi korik i rupaat i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' taqe i jalal ruq'oral i Dios Hageo, i Zacarías rak'uun i Iddo xkiq'or reh taqe aj Judío wilkeeb' Judá, wilkeeb' Jerusaleem i xq'orarik keh ruum i qaDios i hoj, i hoj aj Israel re' i wilik kuuk'. <verse number="2" style="v" />Noq xkib'iraj chi je' re' i Zorobabel rak'uun i Salatiel, ruch'ihil i Jesúa i rak'uun i Josadoc xi okik wo' chik chi kamanik ruka'peech chi rutinamiit i rupaat i Dios ar Jerusaleem. Eh re' taqe i jalal ruq'oral i Dios wilik i koq kuuk' chi kitoob'jiik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh chupaam taqe q'iij re' re', re' i Tatnai re' i wilik chi taaq'anik i wilik wii' i nim ha' Éufrates ruch'ihil i Setar-boznai, haa' taqe i kuch'ihil junch'uq xi k'uloq kuuk' i kamanoom, je' wili i xkiq'or: ¿Awach taq xq'orik aweh chi xatokik wo' chik taq chi rutinamiit i rupaat i Dios, je' wo' hoq i koraal tz'aq? inki taqe. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh xkipahqaaj wo' chi je' wili: ¿Chib'ih kib'ihnaal i k'ahchi' keeb' chi rutinamiit taqe i wili? inki taqe. <verse number="5" style="v" />Xa re' la', re' i QaJaaw Dios k'ahchi' rutoob'iniik keh i k'amal kib'eeh taqe i aj Judío, ruum aj re' ma' xkikanaa' taj i kamanik, korehtaal xkitaq'aaj reje ruq'orariik chi huuj reh i reey Dario reh chi naa ruchaq'weem chaloq mi neenkikanaa' i kamanik oon ma' nee ta nkikanaa'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' Tatnai re' wilik chi taaq'anik chupaam i ye'aab' wilik reje parookb'aal q'iij chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates, ruch'ihil Setar-boznai, haa' taqe i kuch'ihil xkitaq'aaj reje ruhuuj i reey Dario. <verse number="7" style="v" />Je' wili i ruq'or chupaam:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">Re' hat qajaaw reey Dario re' hoj inq'ataq'aaj reje rusuqkiil ak'ux.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hoj inq'ataq'aaj reje ruq'orariik aweh chi xoj ponik chupaam i ye'aab' Judá xqilow chi k'ahchi' kiyejaam i rupaat i Dios nim rajaawriik, eh ruuk' i nimaq taq ab'aj, k'ahchi' kiyejaam. Eh k'ahchi' kib'urum i koq kiwach i tz'aq ruuk' taqe i holohaq chee' k'ahchi' kinik'eem kiq'iij chi kamanik, eh holohik k'ahchi' reliik chikiwach. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' hoj xqapahqaaj keh i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Judío chi awach xye'wik q'ab' keh chi xkitoq'aa' wo' chik ruyejeb'jiik rupaat i Dios, eh chi xkikoj i koq i holohaq chee' chuwach i tz'aq. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh xqapahqaaj wo' hoq chib'ih kib'ihnaal i k'ahchi' keeb' chi kamanik reh naq chi naa qataq'aam reje ruq'orariik i kib'ihnaal. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' keh je' wili i chaq'wik xkian:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">Re' hoj, hoj raj kamanoom i QaJaaw Dios nim rajaawriik chikinaah i wilkeeb' pan taxaaj i je' wo' chikinaah i wilkeeb' wach ak'al. Re' reh k'ahchi' qayejaam i rupaat, re' wo' hoq i xuyejaa' kahnoq najtir i jinaj i runimaal wach reey wihinaq cho Israel. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe i qamaam qati't xkijosaj wach i rujosq'iil i Dios wilik cho pan taxaaj, je' aj re' noq re' QaJaaw Dios xuq'asaj taqe pan q'ab' i Nabucodonosor i kireey i aj Babilonia, eh aj Caldeo. Re' i reey re' re' xyojwik reh i rupaat i Dios, eh xuk'am taqe reje i Babilonia i qamaam qati't. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh koq'uun chik noq jinaj chik haab' i rokiik chi reyil Babilonia i Ciro xuq'or chi naa wo' chik ruyejeb'jiik chi korik i rupaat i Dios.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eh xuq'or wo' hoq i reey i Ciro chi xelik chaloq taqe i kulk, re' ruuk' i plata, i oro chupaam i rupaat taqe i tiyoox wilik Babilonia, re' taqe i xresaj reje i Nabucodonosor chupaam i rupaat i Dios ar Jerusaleem. Re' taqe i kulk re' re' xuq'asaj reh i Sesbasar, re' i Ciro xupab'aa' chi taaq'anik chikinaah aj Judá. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh je' wili i xuq'or i Ciro reh i Sesbasar: Chawesaj taqe i kulk nenooj aq'asaj chupaam i rupaat i Dios ar Jerusaleem, neenaq'or chi ar wo' chik neen korjik i rupaat i Dios aha' xkorjik wii' pampeet, inki. <verse number="16" style="v" />Je' aj re' noq re' i Sesbasar xchalik Jerusaleem xukoj i raa' i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios. Ar aj xtohq'ik cho ruyejeb'jiik i rupaat i Dios, eh xakomajaa' ta wo' inkuxik ruyejeb'jiik.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hoj qajaaw reey inqapahqaaj aweh chi sik'aroq chupaam i huuj molik chupaam i paat i na a'n wii' i taaq'anik ar Babilonia. Ar neenasik' chi riij mi korik chi re' reey Ciro, xataaq'anik ruq'orariik chi naa wo' chik rukorjiik i rupaat i Dios. Eh inqaaj chi nee naa taq'aaj cho ruq'orariik qeh aha' wilik inawaaj chi neenqa'an, inki taqe.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh re' reey Dario xutaq'aaj wo' rusik'ariik i huuj chupaam i paat i rub'an wii' i taaq'anik ar Babilonia. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh xponik wo' kireq i junb'oht chi huuj ar Acmeta chupaam i paat i rub'an wii' i taaq'anik i reey wilik paruyuq'ul Media je' wili i ruq'or i tz'ihb'amaj chupaam:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pampeet haab' rokiik chi reyil i Ciro xukoj i k'uhb'aal chi riij i rupaat i Dios wilik Jerusaleem je' wili xuq'or: Chakoj taq i raa' i rupaat i Dios naa wo' chik taq ayejaam chi korik, reh chi ar naa ruq'ahteesjiik i mayiij. Eh lajeeb' ru ka'winaq b'ara runimaal wach, eh lajeeb' wo' ru ka'winaq b'ara runajtiil naah taq naa a'nam. <verse number="4" style="v" />Noq naa taq ayejaam i tz'aq, oxlok' i nimaq ab'aj, junlok' i chee' ko ak' taq naa akojom, eh re' i tumiin naa rusachariik chi riij taqe re', re' reey naa rutojwiik. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' taqe kulk re' ruuk' i oro, i plata resam choo parupaat i Dios Jerusaleem i Nabucodonosor i xuk'am cho Babilonia, naa wo' chik ruk'amariik reje Jerusaleem naa wo' chik ruye'ariik parupaat i Dios, chupaam i ruye'aab', inki chupaam i huuj.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Je' aj re' noq re' reey Dario, je' wili i xuq'or reh i Tatnai i wilik chi taaq'anik chikinaah i tinamit wilkeeb' chi juntar i nim ha' je' wo' reh Setar-boznai, je' wo' keh i ruch'ihil chi taaq'anik. Eleen taq reje Jerusaleem. <verse number="7" style="v" />Chakanaa' taq i wilik chi taaq'anik chinaah i tinamit Judá, je' wo' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i xiyej-anik reh i peet i rupaat i Dios chupaam i ye'aab' korjinaq wii' pampeet. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' hin xin ye'wik taq aweh i k'uhb'aal nik' wach noq naa taq atoob'eem taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Judío reh chi neenkiyejaa' i rupaat i Dios. Ruuk' i tooj naa ruchaliik taq awuuk' juntar i nim ha' Éufrates. Eh naa taq aye'em reh i reey re' re' naa ruye'ariik keh i kamanoom rajlaal, toob'al keh reh chi ma' nee ta pa'lojik i kamanik. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij wilkeeb' Jerusaleem eqal eqal naa ruye'ariik keh i chikop naa rukamaniik keh chi mayiij chuwach i QaJaaw Dios wilik pan taxaaj, re' taqe imas wakax, taqe imas tentzun, taqe i rak'uun tentzun, je' wo' hoq i trigo, riis uuva, aatz'aam, i aseite. <verse number="10" style="v" />Reh chi naa kiq'asam chi holohik laj mayiij chuwach i QaJaaw Dios wilik pan taxaaj, reh chi neenkipahqaaj i rotob'il i Dios chi wiij i hin, hin reey, je' wo' chikiij taqe i wak'uun wixq'uun.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh awach i ma' nee ta runimaj i k'uhb'aal wili neenehteesjik jino'q i rib'ojal i rupaat chuwach i chee' re' re' neent'uyub'jik noq neenkanteesjik. Re' i rupaat naa rusahchiik wach chi jumpech. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' ta naq i QaJaaw Dios xsik'wik wach i Jerusaleem chi ruye'aab' neensachwik wach i reey, i tinamit nee raaj ruyojom i rupaat i Dios. Re' hin i reey Dario xin ye'wik reh i k'uhb'aal wili koruman chi naa runimjiik chi korik i xnuq'or, inki i reey.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuxik ruyejeb'jiik i rupaat i Dios, eh xkiq'asaj pan q'ab' i Dios</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' i Tatnai wilik chi taaq'anik chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates, ruch'ihil i Setar-boznai, je' wo' kuch'ihil junch'uq xkian chi korik i k'uhb'aal xuq'or i reey Dario <verse number="14" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Judío ma' xkipab'aa' taj i ruyejeb'jiik i rupaat i Dios, je' rukab' i xuq'or Hageo, i Zacarías rak'uun i Iddo. Re' rupaat i Dios xkuxik wo' ruyejeb'jiik, je' rukab' i ruq'orom i QaJaaw i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel, je' wo' rukab' i xuq'or i Ciro, i Dario, i Artajerjes, re' taqe i xi wihik chi reyil Persia. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios xkuxik ruyejeb'jiik chupaam i rukab' q'iij reh i rupohool i Adar, re' noq waqiib' chik haab' rokiik chi reyil i Dario ar Persia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj Israel, taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, taqe i aj Levíta, eh chu'nchel i xi k'amarik reje Babilonia xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem pansuqkiil k'uxliis xkiq'asaj pan q'ab' i Dios i rupaat xkorjik. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh noq xkikuxisaj i rupaat i Dios xkiq'asaj chi kimayiij i jinaj siento chi imas wakax, kiib' siento imas tentzun, kijib' siento i rak'uun tentzun, eh kab'laj imas kaprax, ju'jun chikiij i ju'jun ch'uq chi aj Israel. Re' taqe re' xkiyeew chi kimayiij pahqb'al kuyb'al kimahk i aj Israel. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh xkiyeew pan kiye'aab' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij reh i kamanik, xkiyeew wo' pan kiye'aab' taqe i aj Levíta reh chi naa kianam i kikamaj chi kiju'junaal ar Jerusaleem, je' rukab' i k'uhb'aal tz'ihb'amaj chupaam i ruhuuj i Moisés.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i aj Israel xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem xkininq'ijeej i elik chaloq Egipto chupaam i kajlaj rub'eeh i peet poh reh i haab' re' re'. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, taqe aj Levíta kisaqb'isam chik kiib' noq xkininq'ijeej i elik chaloq Egipto, xkiq'asaj i mayijimaj chikop chu'nchel i xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem. Eh pahqb'al wo' kuyb'al kimahk i kuch k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij junch'uq, eh pahqb'al wo' kuyb'al kimahk i keh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh xkian kiwa' reh i runinq'ijiik i elik chaloq Egipto chu'nchel i aj Israel, xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem, re' taqe i k'amooj reje Babilonia. Eh xkian wo' kiwa' haa' taqe i ma' re' ta aj Judío i xkikanaa' rub'aan i ch'uwa' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n i tinamit. Eh xkian jinaj wach kik'ux kuuk' i aj Judío chi rusik'ariik i QaJaaw i qaDios i hoj, i hoj aj Israel <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh wuquub' q'iij xkininq'ijeej ruuk' suq kiil k'uxliis, eh xkik'ux i kaxlanwi'k ma' kojooj ta ch'amb'esb'al reh. Je' re' noq xye'arik cho rusuqkiil kik'ux ruum i Dios, re' reh xye'wik q'ab' chi xitoob'jik cho ruum i kireey i aj Persia ruuk' i ruyejeb'jiik chi korik i rupaat i qaDios i hoj, i hoj aj Israel.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' Esdras haa' taqe i ruch'ihil xiooj k'oloq Jerusaleem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq xwihik Artajerjes chi reyil Persia xwihik chee jinaj winaq Esdras rub'ihnaal. Re' reh rak'uun i Seraías, re' Seraías rak'uun i Azarías, re' Azarías rak'uun i Hilcías. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' Hilcías re' re' rak'uun i Salum. Re' Salum rak'uun i Sadoc. Re' Sadoc rak'uun i Ahitob. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' Ahitob rak'uun i Amarías. Re' Amarías rak'uun i Azarías. Re' Azarías rak'uun i Meraiot. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' Meraiot rak'uun i Zeraías. Re' Zeraías rak'uun i Uzi. Re' Uzi rak'uun i Buqui. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' Buqui rak'uun i Abisúa. Re' Abisúa rak'uun i Fineses. Re' Fineses rak'uun i Eleazar. Re' Eleazar rak'uun i Aarón, re' peet k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh re' i Esdras re' re' rutijem riib' chi korik ruuk' i k'uhb'aal ye'ooj reh i Moisés ruum i QaJaaw Dios, re' qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel. Ruum chi re' i QaJaaw Dios xtoob'inik reh i Esdras chu'nchel i xupahqaaj reh i reey Artajerjes xye'arik reh. Re' Esdras xelik cho Babilonia xchalik Jerusaleem. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh noq wuquub' chik haab' rokiik chi reyil i Artajerjes, wilik taqe i aj Israel xi sutinik cho chi riij Jerusaleem, wilik taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, wilik taqe i aj Levíta, wilik taqe i aj tz'uyineel, wilik taqe i kicha'jinik reh taqe i ru puertahiil i rupaat i Dios, wilik taqe i kikamanik chupaam i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh chupaam i roo' poh reh i ruwuuq haab' rokiik chi reyil i Artajerjes noq xponik Jerusaleem i Esdras. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ruum re' i Esdras chupaam i k'amb'al rub'eeh i peet poh reh i haab' re' re' xelik cho Babilonia. Eh xponik Jerusaleem chupaam i k'amb'al rub'eeh roo' poh, eh re' i QaJaaw Dios xwihik ruuk' chi rutoob'jiik. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' Esdras xuyeew ruk'ux chutijiik chub'anariik i ruq'or i k'uhb'aal xq'orarik reh ruum i QaJaaw Dios. Eh xuyeew wo' ruk'ux chi k'uhtjiik keh i aj Israel i tz'ihb'amaj chupaam i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' Esdras k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, aj tz'ihb', rutijem riib' chi korik ruuk' chu'nchel i ruk'uhb'aal xq'orarik keh i aj Israel, je' wili i ruq'or i huuj xye'arik reh ruum i reey Artajerjes:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' hin i reey Artajerjes nim wajaawriik chikinaah taqe i reey. Re' hat Esdras k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij atijem wiib' ruuk' chu'nchel i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios wilik cho pan taxaaj, i nutaq'aaj reje rusuqkiil ak'ux.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' hin i xnuyeew jinaj i k'uhb'aal chi chu'nchel i aj Israel wilkeeb' chi ri'sil i wajaawriik, re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, taqe i aj Levíta wila' inkaaj ojik Jerusaleem, neerub'an chi nee kiooj chawiij. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ruum re' hin i reey wuch'ihil taqe i wuquub' chi kojol nuna'ojb'al k'ahchi' nutaaq'aniik taq reje aweh chi rilariik chib'ih jariik i k'ahchi' Judá, je' wo' Jerusaleem, eh mi k'ahchi' rub'aan aha' wilik i ruq'or i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios wilik panaq'ab'. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' i plata, i oro, xchalik panuk'ux ruye'ariik i hin, hin reey je' wo' xchalik pankik'ux ruye'ariik taqe i wuquub' chi kojol nuna'ojb'al neenuk'am reje, nee naq'asaj parupaat i QaJaaw i qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel ar Jerusaleem. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh re' plata, i oro, neenamol wach chupaam i ruyuq'ul i Babilonia. Eh re' taqe i naakisihim i tinamit, i naakisihim i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, naa ak'amam reje chi yejemb'al reh i rupaat i Dios ar Jerusaleem. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ruuk' wo' tumiin re' re' naa aloq'om taqe kok' imas wakax, je' wo' taqe imas tentzun, je' wo' taqe i tentzun, je' wo' taqe i wach i tik xa chi naq'wach, je' wo' hoq i riis uuva. Re' taqe re' naa aq'asam taq chi amayiij chinaah i artaal wilik parupaat taq aaWaJaaw aaDios wilik Jerusaleem. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh re' i ruqox i oro, i plata, re' hat haa' taqe awuch'ihil cha a'n taq ruuk' chib'ih inawaaj taq i hat, xa re' la' je'-oq rukab' iraaj i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i kulk q'ahteesjik aweh inkamanik parukamaj i Dios chaq'asaj wo' chik i hat chupaam i rupaat i Dios ar Jerusaleem.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Wila' chib'ih chik jariik i xkamanik taq aweh chupaam i rupaat i Dios neerub'an chi nee taq inaloq' ruuk' i tumiin neenuyeew i hin, inki reey. <verse number="21" style="v" />Re' hin i reey Artajerjes k'achi' nuye'em i k'uhb'aal wili keh i molol tumiin wilkeeb' chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates chi kiyeew chi jumehq'iil chib'ih i neenapahqaaj i hat Esdras. Re' hat k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij atijem awiib' chi korik ruuk' chu'nchel i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios wilik cho pan taxaaj. <verse number="22" style="v" />Neenkiyeew i kab'laj miil ruuk' ho'oob' siento kintaal chi plata, eh kiib' ru ka'winaq miil pajb'al i trigo, eh kiib' miil ruuk' kiib' siento nimaq lemeta i riis uuva, eh kiib' miil ruuk' kiib' siento nimaq lemeta i aseite, re' aatz'aam naakiye'em chi ma' pajooj taj.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i rupahqaaj i Dios wilik cho pan taxaaj neen kamanik reh i rupaat, ajwaal wach chi naa ruye'ariik chi jumehq'iil. Reh chi ma' nee ta nchalik i ti' k'axik chikinaah i wilkeeb' chi ri'sil i wajaawriik, je' wo' chikinaah i wak'uun wixq'uun i hin. <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh i nuq'or wo' hoq chi ma' naa ta kitojom riij i chib'ih keh chu'nchel i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, je' wo' taqe i aj Levíta, je' wo' taqe i aj tz'uyineel, je' wo' taqe i kicha'jinik reh taqe i ru puertahiil i rupaat i Dios. Eh ma' naa ta wo' rupahqaljiik i tooj keh i kikamanik chupaam i rupaat i Dios.</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh re' hat Esdras ruuk' ana'ojb'al ruye'em aaDios chapab'aa' taqe i q'atal q'orik chapab'aa' wo' taqe i aj taq'oom chikinaah chu'nchel i tinamit wilkeeb' chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates. Re' taqe i naa apab'aam koruman chi keht'al-oq chi korik taqe i ruk'uhb'aal aaDios, eh wila' ma' keht'al koruman chi naa ak'uhtaam keh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh awach i ma' xub'an chi korik i ruk'uhb'aal aaDios, je' wo' nuk'uhb'aal i hin inchol ruq'atariik i q'orik chinaah chi jumehq'iil neenkanteesjik, oon neenehteesjik reje parutinamiit, oon neerutoj riij chi tumiin i ru mahk, inki reey.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' Esdras xub'an rutiij</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh re' Esdras xub'an rutiij je' wili xuq'or: Neeta naq inye'arik ruloq'il i QaJaaw re' ki Dios qamaam qati't, ruum re' reh xye'wik reh paránima i reey chi xuyeew ruloq'il i rupaat i Dios wilik Jerusaleem. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ruum wo' hoq chi xirutoob'eej i hin, noq wilkiin chuwach i reey, je' wo' chikiwach i kojol runa'ojb'al, je' wo' chikiwach i nimaq kiwach kikamanik ruuk' i reey, xuyeew rukowiil nuk'ux. Eh ruuk' wo' rotob'il i Dios xnub'an rumolariik kiwach taqe i aj Israel nimaq kiwach reh chi naa kojiik chi wiij Jerusaleem, inki.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' wili i kib'ihnaal i xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem ruch'ihil i Esdras</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' Esdras je' wili xuq'or: Re' wili i kib'ihnaal taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i ju'jun chi patineel, i xi chalik chi wiij noq xinelik cho Babilonia, noq wilik chi reyil i Artajerjes:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Fineses re' Gersón. Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Tamar, re' i Daniel. Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam David, re' i Hatús. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Secanías, ruch'ihil taqe i riih rumaam i Paros, re' i Zacarías. Eh wilik taqe i ma' tokoom ta ruuk' i Paros ruch'ihil jinaj siento ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl taqe chi winaq. <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam Pahat-moab, re' Elioenai rak'uun Zacarías, ruch'ihil taqe i kiib' siento chi winaq. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam, re' Secanías rak'uun i Jahaziel, ruch'ihil taqe ixib' siento chi winaq. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' i xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Adín, re' i Ebed rak'uun i Jonatán, ruch'ihil taqe i lajeeb' roxk'ahl chi winaq. <verse number="7" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Elam, re' i Jesaías rak'uun i Atalías, ruch'ihil taqe i lajeeb' ru kajwinaq chi winaq. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Sefatías, re' i Zebadías rak'uun i Micael, ruch'ihil taqe i kajwinaq chi winaq. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Joab, re' i Obadías rak'uun i Jehiel, ruch'ihil taqe i kiib' siento ruuk' waxaqlaj chi winaq. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' k'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Selomit, re' i rak'uun i Josifías, ruch'ihil taqe i jinaj siento ruuk' oxk'ahl chi winaq. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Bebai, re' i Zacarías rak'uun i Bebai ruch'ihil taqe i waxiqiib' ru ka'winaq chi winaq. <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' k'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Azgad, re' i Johanán rak'uun i Hacatán, ruch'ihil taqe i jinaj siento ruuk' lajeeb' chi winaq. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam i Adonicam je' wili kib'ihnaal: Elifelet, Jeiel, Semaías, re' xi wihik koq'uun, kuch'ihil taqe i oxk'ahl chi winaq. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' xk'amwik cho kib'eeh i riih rumaam Bigvai, re' i Utai, i Zabud, kuch'ihil taqe i kijib' ru kajwinaq chi winaq.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ar qamol qiib' chi chii' i nim ha' Ahava, wuch'ihil taqe i xi chalik chiqiij, eh ixib' q'iij xoj kahnik ar. Eh noq xnusik' chi kixilak i tinamit, chi kixilak i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij taqe i aj Levíta, ma' jino'q i xnureq. <verse number="16" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' hin xnuyuq'eej taqe i Eliezer, Ariel, i Semaías, i Elnatán, i Jarib, i Elnatán jinaj chik, i Zacarías, i Mesulam. Re' taqe winaq re' re' k'amal b'eeh taqe. Eh xnuyuq'eej wo' taqe Joiarib, i Elnatán, re' taqe re' aj tijoom. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh xnutaq'aaj taqe reje ruuk' i Iddo, re' k'amal b'eeh chupaam i ye'aab' Casifia. Eh xnuq'or reje keh chib'ih i naa kiq'orom ponoq reh i Iddo, je' wo' naa kiq'orom pookeh i ruch'ihil, re' taqe i kikamanik chupaam i rupaat i Dios wilik ar Casifia. Re' hin xnutaq'aaj taqe ar reh chi naa kik'amam cho qeh taqe i naakikamaniik chupaam i rupaat i Dios. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ruum chi re' Dios xtoob'inik qeh xkireq chaloq i Serabías, reh chi xchalik chi kamanik, jinaj winaq holohik runa'ojb'al, re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Mahli aj Levíta. Eh xchalik ruch'ihil taqe i rak'uun, ruch'ihil taqe i ras, waxaqlaj chi kiib. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eh xkik'am wo' cho qeh i Hasabías i Jesaías re' ruuk' taqe i riih rumaam i Merari, xi chalik wo' haa' i kas, haa' taqe i kak'uun xponik juninaq chi kiib'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh xkik'am wo' cho qeh i kiib' siento ruuk' juninaq xi kamanik chupaam i rupaat i Dios re' ruuk' taqe i kiih kimaam i rupab'aam kahnoq i reey David, xukoj taqe chi kito'ariik i aj Levíta chi kamanik chupaam i rupaat i Dios. Eh tz'ihb'amaj i kib'ihnaal chi kiju'junaal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh chi chii' i rooq haa' Ahava xnuq'or keh chi naa qa'nam qatiij chi ma' qa'nam ta qawa' chi naa qaloch'om qiib' chuwach i QaJaaw Dios. Reh chi xqapahqaaj reh chi xojrutoob'eej, chi ma' xta xqak'ul panqab'eeh i hoj, je' wo' taqe i kok' qaha'lak'uun, je' wo' taqe chib'ih qeh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Je' re' xqa'an ruum re' hin xink'ixik chupahqaljiik reh reey taqe i soldado rij kawáyu kib'ehik reh chi xooj kiko'leej naq pan kiq'ab' i aj ixowaal wach b'eeh. Ruum wo' hoq chi qaq'orom chik ree reey chi re' i Dios intoob'inik keh awach i kinimanik reh i Dios. Eh ruyeew chee rujosq'iil i Dios chikinaah inkiq'eb' chi riij kik'ux i reh, kinki reh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Je' aj re' noq xooj okik chi tiij chi ma' qa'nam ta qawa' qahaa', xqapahqaaj reh chu'nchel i re' xuyeew wo' qeh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh jumehq'iil xnusik' kiwach i kab'laj chi k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij. Re' i Serebías, re' i Hasabías, eh lajeeb' chik i kuch'ihil. <verse number="25" style="v" />Re' hin xnupaj xnuq'asaj keh i plata, i oro, taqe i kulk inkamanik parukamaj i Dios, re' taqe i ruq'asam chi rumayiij i reey reh i QaJaaw Dios, je' wo' i xkiyeew taqe i kojol nuna'ojb'al, i xkiyeew i nimaq wach kikamaj ruuk' i reey, i xkiyeew chu'nchel i aj Israel wilkeeb' ar. <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh je' wili k'ihaal i xpajarik xnuq'asaj keh: Jinaj ru ka'winaq miil ruuk' kiib' siento ruuk' lajeeb' roxk'ahl pajb'al i plata, ixib' miil ruuk' ixib' siento pajb'al i oro, jinaj siento pajb'al i kulk re' ruuk' i plata inkamanik parukamaj i Dios. <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh juninaq i kulk re' ruuk' i oro, waqlaj libra rahliil waxiqiib' pajb'al, kiib' i kulk re' ruuk' i q'an ch'ihch' xiik' naah holwochiil xan worwotik chik xa je' chik oro, xiik' naah k'ihaal tz'aaq'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chi riij i re' je' wili i xnuq'or keh: Re' taq i hat, hat taq q'asamaj pan q'ab' i QaJaaw Dios, je' rukab' taqe i kulk wili, taqe plata, taqe oro xq'ahteesjik chi mayiij chuwach i ki Dios i qamaam qati't. <verse number="29" style="v" />Chawilow, chamol taq chi korik, korehtaal impajarik chikiwach i kajaaw i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, chikiwach i aj Levíta. Eh chikiwach i k'amal kib'eeh i ju'jun chi patineel wilkeeb' Jerusaleem. Ar taq neenapaj chupaam i rupaat i Dios, kinki keh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xkik'ul wo' hoq i plata, oro, je' wo' taqe i kulk, noq pajooj chik taqe reh chi xkik'am cho chupaam i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios Jerusaleem.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eh chupaam i k'amb'al rub'eeh i poh reh i haab' re' re' xoj ooj cho chi chii' i nim ha' Ahava, xoj chalik Jerusaleem. Eh re' i QaJaaw Dios xoj rutoob'eej, xoj ruko'leej wo' pan kiq'ab' i aj ixowaal yiib' wach kina'ojb'al wilkeeb' naq panqab'eeh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Eh noq xoj k'ulik Jerusaleem ixib' q'iij xoj hi'lik. <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh parukaaj q'iij i oro, i plata, je' wo' taqe i kulk chupaam i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios. Chu'nchel i re' xq'ahteesjik reh i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij Meremol rub'ihnaal rak'uun i Urías, ruch'ihil i Eleazar rak'uun i Finees, ruch'ihil taqe i aj Levíta Jozabad i Jesúa, eh ruch'ihil i Noadías rak'uun i Binúi. <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh xa chupaam wo' q'iij re' re' xkipaj xkajlaaj, eh xkitz'ihb'aaj nik' k'ihaal xelik chikiwach i xkik'am chaloq, eh xkiq'asaj.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Eh re' taqe aj Israel xi elik cho Babilonia xi chalik Jerusaleem xkik'at chi kimayiij taqe i chikop chuwach i QaJaaw Dios. Eh kab'laj chi kok' imas wakax i xkiq'asaj pankib'ihnaal i kab'laj ch'uq chi tinamit Israel, waqiib' chik ma' jinaj siento taqe imas tentzun, wuqlaj ru kajwinaq taqe i rak'uun tentzun, eh kab'laj taqe imas kaprax, re' taqe re' xkiq'asaj chi mayiij chuwach i QaJaaw Dios. <verse number="36" style="v" />Eh xkiq'asaj keh i k'uhb'aal xuyeew i reey, xkiq'asaj wo' keh i wilkeeb' chi taaq'anik chupaam taqe tinamit wilkeeb' chi juntar i nim ha' Éufrates. Re' i xi okik haa' chuyejeb'jiik i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' mahk xkian i aj Israel, re' rutiij i Esdras</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chi riij chik taqe re', re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Israel xi chalik wuuk' je' wili xkiq'or weh: Wilik taqe i quch aj Israel, wilik taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, wilik taqe i aj Levíta, k'ahchi' kianam keh i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n i aj cananeo, aj heteo, aj ferezeo, aj jebuseo, aj amonita, taqe aj moabita, taqe aj Egipto, taqe aj amorreo, eh xkian jinaj wach kik'ux kuuk'. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' keh, eh re' kak'uun xkian kaxáro kuuk' i kixq'uun taqe tinamit re' re'. Je' re' noq re' rusantolaj tinamiit i Dios, xkian jinaj wach kik'ux kuuk' i tokoom tinamit. Re' taqe i peet xib'anik reh taqe mahk wili re' taqe i k'amal b'eeh, re' taqe i wilkeeb' chi taaq'anik, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh noq xb'iraj taqe i q'orik wili xnuxih i nuso' chi wiij, xnuchuq i rismaal nunaah, xnichuq wo' wusinchii'. Eh xnutzunaa' wiib' wach ak'al chi xiik' naah ti'kiil nuk'ux. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i re' xkimol kiib' wuuk' xchalik kiyo'jiik chi re' Dios naa ruye'em chee ti' k'axik chikinaah ruum i mahk k'ahchi' keeb' taqe i kuch aj Israel xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem. Re' hin ma' k'isiin ti'kiil nuk'ux xa xin kahnik wo' ar chi tzunulkiin, korehtaal xureq i ora reh i ruye'ariik i mayiij ree xq'eq. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh chupaam i ru orahiil i ruye'ariik i mayiij ree xq'eq xin wuktik johtoq aha' naq tzunulkiin wii' chi ti' nuk'ux, xa koxiheel wo' nuso' chi wiij xnuxuk'aa' wiib' xnujosaj johtoq i nuq'ab' chub'aan i nutiij chuwach i QaJaaw Dios, <verse number="6" style="v" />je' wili i xnuq'or: WaJaaw nuDios, re' hin insahchik nuk'ux yohb'aal wach i nuk'ixiik noq i nujosaj johtoq i nuwach chaq'orob'jiik, ruum xiik' naah i mahk inqa'an chawach. Eh xiik' naah i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inqa'an, imponik kopan taxaaj. <verse number="7" style="v" />Xa je' wo' re' i mahk xkian chee qamaam qati't, eh xa ko je' wo' re' i k'ahchi'kooj i hoj yu'naak. Eh ruum chi xiik' naah i qamahk i hoj, je' wo' taqe i k'amal qab'eeh, taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, taqe i qareey, xoj q'ahtesjik pan kiq'ab' i kireey i tokoom tinamit, xoj kichop xoj kik'am reje pan tokoom tinamit. Wilik qeh i xi kanteesjik ruuk' i q'aslaj ch'ihch', xkelq'aaj i chee chib'ih qeh, xkik'uhtaaj qak'ixb'ilaal, eh xa ko je' wo' re' i k'ahchi' qak'ulum yu'naak. <verse number="8" style="v" />Xa re' la' yu'naak waJaaw nuDios xaketelaaj qawach ruum xoj ako'leej i hoj, hoj awak'uun awixq'uun nik' chik qak'ihaal i koxoj kahnik chi k'achalkooj. Eh xayeew wo' chik qa ye'aab' chupaam i santo laj ye'aab' aha' ma' xta naa qak'ulum, inak'uhtaaj chi qawach i qab'eeh, xoj ayeew chi hi'lik junk'aam-oq. <verse number="9" style="v" />Atoob' ta wilkooj wo' naq chi ri'sil i rajaawriik i kireey i aj Persia, re' hat xama' xoj akanaa' ta wo' chi qutkeel. Eh chikiwach i reey xak'uhtaaj qeh awotob'il, xayeew qak'achariik reh chi naa wo' chik qayejaam aapaat, re' i yojoj cho najtir. Re' hat xat ko'linik qeh ayu' Judá, je' wo' Jerusaleem.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Xa re' la' yu'naak waJaaw nuDios ¿Chib'ih jariik i neenqaq'or chi riij i xa a'n cho quuk' re' re'? Re' hoj ma' xqa'an ta taqe i ruq'or aak'uhb'aal. <verse number="11" style="v" />Re' i xaq'or keh taqe i jalal aq'oral, re' taqe awaj kamanoom. Re' keh xkiq'or qeh chib'ih i ruq'or chupaam aak'uhb'aal, xaq'or keh i qamaam qati't chi re' ye'aab' naa kojiik wii' chi wihik nujinaq chi ch'uwa' wach na'ojb'al ruum i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n i tinamit wilkeeb' ar. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh xaq'or chi re' taqe i qixq'uun i hoj ma' naa ta kianam kaxáro kuuk' kak'uun i tokoom tinamit re' re'. Eh chi ma' naa ta kianam kaxáro i qak'uun i hoj kuuk' i kixq'uun i keh. Eh chi ma' naa ta qawihiik pansuqkiil k'uxliis kuuk' ni xata naa qatoob'eem taqe reh chi nee kielik korik. Reh chi re' hoj naa ruwihiik qakowiil, eh chi naaqanam rusuqkiil i suq atoob' wilik chupaam i ye'aab' re' re', chi naa qakanaam kahnoq keh chi juneliik qiih qamaam.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' ti k'axik xqak'ul ruum i ma' holohik taj, ruum i runimaal mahk xqa'an. Xa re' la' re' hat QaJaaw Dios ma' xoj ayeew ta chutojariik i qamahk je' naq rukab' i ruk'ul chi qeh, ma' xkuxik ta asacham qawach. <verse number="14" style="v" />¿Mi neerub'an yu'naak re' chi neenqaq'et wachej taqe aak'uhb'aal neeqa a'n qeh je' rukab' i xkian i tinamit re' re' yiib' wach i kina'ojb'al? ¿Mi ma' nee naq inchalik re' aajosq'iil ruum i qamahk mi ma' nee naq inkuxik asacham qawach re'?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />QaJaaw Dios, qaDios i hoj, hoj aj Israel, re' hat korik wach ak'ux quuk' ruum juntzuhb' qeh i hoj i xoj akanaa' chi k'achalkooj yu'naak xoj ako'leej. Xti korik wo' hoq chi wilik qamahk chawach, je' re' noq ma' ruk'ul taj chi tiqaq'o'reej johtoq, inki parutiij i Esdras.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' noq xi ehteesjik reje ixoq kichalik pan tokoom tinamit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noq k'ahchi' chi tiij i Esdras xuklik chuwach i rupaat i QaJaaw Dios, ruuk' oq'ik k'ahchi' rupahqaam kuyb'al ru mahk i tinamit. Eh xi ponik ruuk' i juntzuhb' chi aj Israel xkikotej riij, chi winaq chi ixoq, chi ha'lak'un, oq'ik inki a'n ruum i ruti'kiil kik'ux. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh re' i Secanías rak'uun i Jehiel, riih rumaam i Elam, je' wili i xuq'or reh i Esdras: Xti korik wo' hoq chi xoj mahkunik chuwach i qaDios, ruum re' hoj xqa'an kaxáro kuuk' ixoq kichalik pan tokoom tinamit. Atoob' ta je' re' i xqa'an koneeruyeew riib' chi neenqako'leej qiib' i hoj, hoj aj Israel. <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' hoj naaqayejaam wach ruuk' i QaJaaw Dios chi naa qataq'aam taqe reje i qehk'een kichalik pan tokoom tinamit, je' wo' taqe i qak'uun qixq'uun wilik kuuk'. Reh chi neenb'aan inaq'or qeh i hat, inkiq'or i kiyohlinik reh i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios. Neeta naq imb'aan taqe i ruq'or i ruk'uhb'aal i Dios. <verse number="4" style="v" />Je' re' noq wukteen johtoq i hat Esdras, ruum re' taqe i wili re' hat naa ab'aniik reh. Eh re' hoj wilkooj chi atoob'jiik, chakowej ak'ux chub'anariik, chatoq'aa' rub'aan, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' Esdras xwuktik johtoq, xuq'or keh i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij, keh i aj Levíta, eh keh chu'nchel i aj Israel chi naa kiq'orom i xti korik chi naa kianam aha' wilik i xkiq'or. Eh re' keh xkiq'or wo' i xti korik chi naa kianam chu'nchel i xq'orarik. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' Esdras xelik reje chuwach i rupaat i Dios, xooj parupaat i Johanán rak'uun i Eliasib, re' ixrik'saj wii' i jinaj aq'ab' chi ma' rub'anam ta ruwa' ruhaa'. Ruum xiik' naah tz'irkiil wach ruum i mahk xkian i aj Israel i xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chi riij i re' xutaq'aaj ruq'orariik keh i aj Judá, je' wo' keh i aj Jerusaleem, chi naa kimolom kiib' pan tinamit Jerusaleem, re' taqe i xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem. <verse number="8" style="v" />Eh re' taqe i wilik kajaawriik, ruch'ihil taqe i k'amal kib'eeh i aj Judío, xkimol wach i tinamit. Awach i ma' xponik taj chuwach ixib' q'iij naa ruq'uchariik i chib'ih reh, eh naa rehtesjiik reje chi kixilak i aj Israel xi sutinik wo' chik cho Jerusaleem. <verse number="9" style="v" />Eh paroox q'iij chu'nchel i winaq i aj Judá, taqe i aj Benjamín, xkimol kiib' Jerusaleem chupaam i juninaq rub'eeh i rub'eleej poh reh i haab' re' re'. Eh chi kunchelaal xkitzunaa' kiib' chupaam i tehlik wilik chucheel i rupaat i Dios, eh xakib'arb'otik chik ruum kiyo'jiik, ruum i naakik'ulum, eh ruum i jab' k'ahchi' kik'ulum. <verse number="10" style="v" />Eh re' i Esdras k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xpa'lojik johtoq je' wili xuq'or keh:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' taq i hat xat mahkunik taq ruum xa a'n taq kaxáro kuuk' ixoq kichalik pan tokoom tinamit. Je' re' noq xakoj taq ruman amahk i hat taq aj Israel. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh yu'naak cha pahqaaj taq kuyb'al amahk chuwach i QaJaaw Dios, ki Dios chaloq i qamaam qati't. Cha a'n taq iraaj i reh, chawesaj taq awiib' chi kixilak ma' kinimanik ta ree Dios, chach'aq taq awiib' kuuk' ixoq kichalik pan tokoom tinamit, inki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eh chu'nchel i tinamit kimolom kiib' ar, xkik'er kichii' chuq'orariik chi je' wili:</para>
  <para style="p">Neen qa'an je' rukab' i xaq'or i hat. <verse number="13" style="v" />Xa re' la' re' hoj xiik' naah qak'ihaal wilkooj ayu' rij paat chuwach i runimaal jab', ma' nee ta rub'an chi neenqayejaa' wach ayu' ruum ma' nee ta nkorjik wach ruuk' i jinaj q'iij, ni xata ruuk' i kiib' q'iij, ruum xiik' naah qak'ihaal xoj b'anik reh taqe mahk re' re'. <verse number="14" style="v" />Noq inqaq'or i hoj chi nee naq i rub'an chi xa re' taqe i k'amal qab'eeh nee kikahnik ayu', re' keh neekiq'orik chiqiij. Eh awach taqe i kianam kaxáro kuuk' ixoq aj pan tokoom tinamit, neerub'an chi nee kichalik chupaam chik jino'q i q'iij neen q'orarik keh. Neekichalik i wilkeeb' chupaam i ju'jun chi tinamit kuch'ihil taqe i q'atal q'orik, kuch'ihil taqe i wilkeeb' chi taaq'anik chupaam i kitinamiit, reh chi nee nelik i rujosq'iil i QaJaaw Dios chi qanaah, inki taqe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eh re' Jonatán i rak'uun i Asael, Jahazías rak'uun i Ticva, eh kiib' keh i aj Levíta, re' Mesulam, re' i Sabetai, ma' xuk'ul ta kik'ux i xkiq'or i tinamit, xa re' wo' re' ma' xuk'ul ta kik'ux. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh xb'aan wo' hoq i xkiq'or i tinamit. Re' i Esdras i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij xusik' kiwach i winaq xtoob'inik keh. Re' taqe ink'amwik kib'eeh i ju'jun chi patineel, eh xiyuq'ub'jik ruuk' i kib'ihnaal chi kiju'junaal, pank'amb'al rub'eeh i ru lajeeb' poh reh i haab' re' re'. Re' keh xkisik' chi riij nik' wach noq wilkeeb' i tinamit. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh re' noq xuk'am rub'eeh i peet poh reh i haab' jinaj chik xkikohlaaj rusik'ariik chi riij awach taqe i winaq kianam kaxáro kuuk' ixoq kichalik pan tokoom tinamit.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' taqe i k'amal kib'eeh aj tiij kianam kaxáro kuuk' ixoq kichalik pan tokoom tinamit re' taqe wili:</para>
  <para style="p">Re' taqe i riih rumaam i Jesúa, rak'uun i Josadac, eh chi kixilak taqe i ruchaaq' re' taqe wili: Re' i Maasías, re' i Eliezer, re' i Jarib, re' i Jeladias. <verse number="19" style="v" />Re' keh xkiq'or i xti korik chi naa kich'aqam kiib' ruuk' i kehk'een. Eh jinaj imas tentzun xkiq'asaj chi kimayiij pahqb'al kuyb'al kimahk chi riij taqe mahk xkian re' re'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak taqe i riih rumaam i Imir, je' wili kib'ihnaal: Hanani, Zebadías.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Harim je' wili kib'ihnaal: Maasías, Elías, Semaías, Jehiel, re' Uzías.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Pasur je' wili kib'ihnaal: Elioenai, Maasías, Ismael, Natanael, Jozabad, Elasa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Leví je' wili kib'ihnaal: Jozabad, Simei, Kelaia, (re' wo' Kelita) Petaías, Judá, Eliezer.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i aj tz'uyineel re' Eliasib. Eh chi kixilak taqe i kicha'jinik reh i ookb'al reh i rupaat i Dios je' wili kib'ihnaal: Salum, Telem, Uri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak taqe i aj Israel xkian keh i mahk, re' taqe riih rumaam i Paros je' wili kib'ihnaal:</para>
  <para style="p">Ramia, Jezaías, Malquías, Senaias.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Elam je' wili kib'ihnaal: Matanías, Zacarías, Jehiel, Abdi, Jeremot, Elías.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Zatu je' wili kib'ihnaal: Elioenai, Eliasib, Matanías, Jeremot, Zabad, Aziza.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Bebai je' wili kib'ihnaal: Johanán, Hananías, Zabai, Atlai.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Bani je' wili kib'ihnaal: Mesulam, Meluc Adaía, Jasud, Seal, Ramot.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Pahat-moab, je' wili kib'ihnaal: Adna, Quelal, Benaía, Maasías, Matanías, Bezaleel, Binúi Manasés.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Harim je' wili kib'ihnaal: Eliezer, Isías, Malquías, Semaías, Simeón, <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamín, Maluc, Semarías.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Hasum je' wili kib'ihnaal: Matenai, Matatá, Zabad, Elifelet, Jeremai, Manasés, Simei.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Bani je' wili kib'ihnaal: Madai, Amram, Uel, <verse number="35" style="v" />Benaía, Bedías, Queluhi, <verse number="36" style="v" />Vanías, Meremot, Eliasib, <verse number="37" style="v" />Matanías Matenai, Jaasai, <verse number="38" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Binúi je' wili kib'ihnaal: Simei <verse number="39" style="v" />Selemías, Natán, Adaía, <verse number="40" style="v" />Macnadebai, Sasai, Sarai, <verse number="41" style="v" />Azareel, Selemías, Semarías, <verse number="42" style="v" />Salum, Amarías, José.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i riih rumaam i Nebo je' wili kib'ihnaal: Jeiel, Matatías, Zabad, Zebina, Jadau, Joel, re' Benaía.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chu'nchel taqe winaq re' re' kianam kaxáro kuuk' ixoq aj pan tokoom tinamit, xa re' la' xkich'aq reje i kehk'een, je' wo' taqe i kak'uun kixq'uun.</para>
</usx>